nting ceremony to affirm this in history. Fredrick Bucklers transfer of Mrs Williams title to BP and their predecessors without her knowledge or consent isn''t legitimate and so has no authority. Him not being able to clarify that transaction due to dying doesn''t make it right as Mary Williams maintained her position after his death. She just couldn''t prove what she claimed without title. And the adjournment and dismissal of the two hearings in 1974 where she made her case, but without getting the ruling doesn''t negate the facts. This was a coordinated campaign of fraud, stealth, and administrative erasure. Over decades. Summary of the Fraudulent Dispossession:

